WEBVTT

00:01.160 --> 00:04.270
For instance,
even if those arms of yours

00:04.270 --> 00:07.100
Become entwined in chains

00:07.100 --> 00:10.410
For instance,
even if this space we live in

00:10.410 --> 00:14.910
Someday will burn completely down

00:14.910 --> 00:21.040
Keep believing in hope, if nothing else

00:22.320 --> 00:26.580
In the shadows of glimmering stars

00:28.390 --> 00:32.660
There is a world governed by darkness

00:34.460 --> 00:38.960
Just one life that is out there

00:40.470 --> 00:45.740
If you keep it entrapped there,
lonely boy

00:46.540 --> 00:52.310
The reason that we met each other here

00:52.310 --> 00:58.650
Must surely exist

00:58.650 --> 01:01.920
For instance,
even if sorrow takes you

01:01.920 --> 01:04.860
And you're about to collapse under it

01:04.860 --> 01:08.200
For instance,
if my chest can become

01:08.200 --> 01:12.570
A power to hold you and keep you there

01:12.570 --> 01:16.970
I'm sure that even
tomorrow we can survive

01:29.750 --> 01:31.010
What?

01:33.520 --> 01:36.720
It's the opposite
of what I usually get...

01:36.720 --> 01:38.320
It's as if it's scared.

01:41.000 --> 01:42.860
What I'm doing has been decided!

01:42.860 --> 01:44.890
Just shut up and watch me!

02:07.920 --> 02:10.560
We'll follow the Nirvana
and wait on the planet!

02:10.560 --> 02:12.590
Watch out for enemy fire as we retreat!

02:12.590 --> 02:14.190
- Roger!
- Meia, to your right!

02:20.540 --> 02:22.470
Geez, you're just a fake, too!

02:24.410 --> 02:25.430
No!

02:32.580 --> 02:33.910
Mr. Alien!

02:45.830 --> 02:46.790
- Leader!
- Meia!

02:56.640 --> 02:57.740
Retreat for now.

02:57.740 --> 02:59.070
Sorry...

02:59.070 --> 03:00.510
We support each other.

03:01.610 --> 03:03.850
Everyone, follow me!

03:03.850 --> 03:04.830
Roger!

03:26.130 --> 03:28.740
That's what you get
for underestimating gravity.

03:28.740 --> 03:29.770
Then again...

03:29.770 --> 03:33.170
I shouldn't joke
since we escaped into it.

03:37.010 --> 03:39.250
Paksis condition is poor!

03:39.250 --> 03:41.520
It's just like when the ships combined.

03:41.520 --> 03:42.980
Geez, of all times...

03:44.290 --> 03:46.790
We have damage reports
from all over the ship!

03:46.790 --> 03:49.290
The pressure outside
is 2.31 gigapascals.

03:49.290 --> 03:50.660
We're in danger of being crushed!

03:55.860 --> 03:58.090
My stomach feels pinched.

03:59.400 --> 04:00.640
Really...

04:00.640 --> 04:04.370
It looks like we can't take
the time to live out our lives here.

04:12.710 --> 04:15.220
No need to worry...

04:15.220 --> 04:16.550
I'll be back soon.

04:20.320 --> 04:22.060
I can't take it anymore!

04:22.060 --> 04:24.660
I don't pick fights that I can't win!

04:24.660 --> 04:26.560
This is all useless!

04:26.560 --> 04:29.000
It's the end anyway...

04:33.940 --> 04:35.300
Mr. Alien...

04:38.070 --> 04:39.470
Disgusting!

04:39.470 --> 04:40.740
Shut up...

04:40.740 --> 04:42.610
So how is it? Can we do it?

04:42.610 --> 04:44.550
Ask all you want. It's impossible.

04:44.550 --> 04:45.550
Why?!

04:45.550 --> 04:49.220
It's true that this planet is
about to turn into a star...

04:49.220 --> 04:52.020
...but this mission
is impossible on your own.

04:53.450 --> 04:55.690
Then what about this plan?

04:55.690 --> 04:58.360
- No good.
- If that's no good, how about...

04:58.360 --> 04:59.720
Humans...

05:04.130 --> 05:06.970
Parfet, can't you do
something about this noise?

05:06.970 --> 05:08.800
On top of maybe being crushed...

05:08.800 --> 05:12.210
...the Paksis pressure is
increasing and about to burst!

05:12.210 --> 05:15.540
The pressure balance may be
able to keep the Paksis here...

05:15.540 --> 05:17.250
But the ship itself...

05:17.250 --> 05:18.310
It can't be...

05:18.310 --> 05:19.640
Self-destruction?

05:22.980 --> 05:24.180
Don't touch me!

05:24.990 --> 05:27.090
If I can't touch you,
I can't treat you.

05:27.090 --> 05:28.990
I won't be in the care of a man!

05:28.990 --> 05:31.120
When did you carry me here?

05:31.630 --> 05:34.500
If I can't treat you,
you won't be able to fight.

05:34.500 --> 05:35.630
Have you forgotten?

05:35.630 --> 05:38.570
I was the one who
shoved you all into cells!

05:38.570 --> 05:40.100
A difference in position.

05:40.100 --> 05:41.600
Nothing to worry about.

05:41.600 --> 05:45.140
I'm treating your wounds as a doctor.

05:45.140 --> 05:46.570
Understood?

05:47.580 --> 05:49.380
Mr. Doctor!

05:49.380 --> 05:50.550
Give me medicine!

05:50.550 --> 05:52.580
Medicine to cheer everyone up!

05:52.580 --> 05:54.220
I understand how you feel.

05:54.220 --> 05:57.020
But I don't think
that's a permanent solution.

05:57.020 --> 06:00.120
But everyone's saying
that it's all over now!

06:00.120 --> 06:01.960
So... So...

06:01.960 --> 06:03.560
That's right! It's over!

06:03.560 --> 06:05.630
We're all going to die!

06:05.630 --> 06:06.590
Pai...

06:06.590 --> 06:10.600
Everyone who came here said,
"We should've ran away!"

06:10.600 --> 06:13.370
They're saying, "Fighting
for Mejale sounds fake."

06:13.370 --> 06:15.770
It kinda ended up feeling that way,

06:15.770 --> 06:19.970
but it's stupid to fight and
die for people we've never seen!

06:19.970 --> 06:21.840
Why do you say that?

06:21.840 --> 06:23.910
Why is it already decided?

06:23.910 --> 06:27.320
In any case, we have
nowhere to run now!

06:27.320 --> 06:28.650
It's all over!

06:31.050 --> 06:33.120
You think so too, Barnette?

06:33.120 --> 06:34.790
Don't ask me.

06:34.790 --> 06:38.950
I've told you how much I hate
your straightforward attitude!

06:41.360 --> 06:43.730
I'm stupid...

06:43.730 --> 06:46.630
...so all I can do is try my best.

06:46.630 --> 06:47.770
I don't like it.

06:47.770 --> 06:49.640
I don't want it...

06:49.640 --> 06:52.340
...ending with everyone being sad.

06:52.340 --> 06:53.640
I definitely don't!

07:03.480 --> 07:07.790
By combining the gas and the Paksis,
we can ignite the planet.

07:07.790 --> 07:09.790
We're fine up to that point.

07:09.790 --> 07:13.430
The question now is finding a way
to gain enough time to escape...

07:13.430 --> 07:15.430
...without igniting ourselves.

07:15.430 --> 07:18.530
It's impossible with
only the Van-type I tell you!

07:18.530 --> 07:20.740
Even if it is, we have to do something!

07:20.740 --> 07:22.460
Have you considered boosters?

07:23.470 --> 07:25.710
There are spare parts
lying around if you look.

07:25.710 --> 07:27.070
Oh, it's you...

07:27.070 --> 07:29.780
That's in the calculations of course.

07:29.780 --> 07:33.750
But we're still
20 seconds short of escaping.

07:33.750 --> 07:34.940
And that's that.

07:37.390 --> 07:38.720
You've changed.

07:38.720 --> 07:40.690
You look much better than in the past.

07:41.690 --> 07:44.660
If you're up to something, do it later.

07:44.660 --> 07:45.890
Not at all.

07:45.890 --> 07:47.330
I'm honestly praising you.

07:50.230 --> 07:53.500
One person's thoughts
moves the masses, huh?

07:54.600 --> 07:56.900
Now I want to see
how you're going to fight.

07:56.900 --> 07:59.910
Everyone! Can you hear me?

07:59.910 --> 08:01.480
We might lose, might die...

08:01.480 --> 08:02.810
You're all acting strange!

08:03.780 --> 08:06.250
This is a battle that
we decided to fight, right?

08:06.250 --> 08:09.850
We decided to fight because we
didn't want someone to decide

08:09.850 --> 08:12.550
our futures with a harvest, right?

08:12.550 --> 08:17.530
But you're all thinking the
future's decided and giving up.

08:17.530 --> 08:19.030
That's a mistake!

08:19.030 --> 08:21.330
Don't say it's all over...

08:21.330 --> 08:24.400
If you say it is, it'll become true!

08:24.400 --> 08:26.900
I'll never say it's over!

08:26.900 --> 08:28.600
I'll never give up!

08:28.600 --> 08:31.240
Because I want to
be with you all forever...

08:31.240 --> 08:33.240
Because I love you all...

08:33.240 --> 08:35.010
So...

08:35.010 --> 08:36.980
You all have to cheer up!

08:38.950 --> 08:40.470
Idiot...

08:49.890 --> 08:50.990
That's right.

08:50.990 --> 08:52.650
I'll do it!

09:06.710 --> 09:07.900
What is this?

09:09.510 --> 09:11.440
Try all you want, it's useless.

09:12.410 --> 09:17.120
You need the permission of the
manager if you want to use that.

09:17.120 --> 09:21.090
It's to keep impatient people
like you from being reckless.

09:21.090 --> 09:22.560
Then authorize it already!

09:22.560 --> 09:24.350
Why are you in such a rush?

09:25.990 --> 09:28.700
Nobody's blaming you for anything.

09:28.700 --> 09:31.390
The only person blaming you is yourself.

09:33.800 --> 09:36.270
It's useless to
act tough now, you know.

09:36.270 --> 09:40.710
Everyone knows the good things
about you as well as the bad.

09:40.710 --> 09:43.770
And they still consider
you a friend despite it all.

09:44.780 --> 09:45.750
Right?

09:47.380 --> 09:49.520
Smile! Smile!

09:49.520 --> 09:51.420
Barnette, let's do our best!

09:51.420 --> 09:54.060
Sorry to make you
worry over it all, Barnette!

09:54.060 --> 09:55.290
It's time to work!

09:55.290 --> 09:56.690
It's going to be busy!

10:01.500 --> 10:04.170
Everyone's cheerful again...

10:04.170 --> 10:05.430
It's starting to move.

10:06.400 --> 10:08.400
Get ready for first aid.

10:08.400 --> 10:09.730
We'll be busy.

10:10.770 --> 10:13.310
I thought that boy was too quiet.

10:13.310 --> 10:15.140
He was thinking this up?

10:16.480 --> 10:18.050
I guess I'll buy it.

10:18.050 --> 10:20.050
Parfet, you heard it, right?

10:20.050 --> 10:21.450
Yes, crystal clear!

10:22.950 --> 10:24.850
10 minutes until burst limit!

10:24.850 --> 10:27.220
Outside pressure is over 4 gigapascals!

10:27.220 --> 10:29.250
Okay, everyone! We're gonna get busy!

10:32.060 --> 10:33.730
This way is impossible.

10:33.730 --> 10:34.730
Shut up!

10:34.730 --> 10:37.060
If we force our way,
logic will pull back!

10:37.060 --> 10:38.590
What about my Dread?

10:39.630 --> 10:41.270
Meia...

10:41.270 --> 10:43.570
Now the speed problem is solved.

10:43.570 --> 10:46.610
I take it you've
thought of the next step?

10:46.610 --> 10:48.340
Of course!

10:48.340 --> 10:50.610
Oh, this is where you are.

10:50.610 --> 10:53.980
You're gravely mistaken if
you thought of leaving me out.

10:53.980 --> 10:57.510
I have quite a nose for
things that seem interesting.

11:08.230 --> 11:10.790
Hurry! That area's being shut down!

11:15.340 --> 11:16.670
You're late!

11:16.670 --> 11:18.170
You really are slow...

11:18.170 --> 11:19.370
Don't just stand there!

11:19.370 --> 11:21.340
You're part of my calculations!

11:22.340 --> 11:24.180
Everyone...

11:24.180 --> 11:26.680
I won't forgive you if you slack off!

11:26.680 --> 11:28.010
Okay!

11:33.420 --> 11:34.960
Let's go, partner...

11:34.960 --> 11:36.190
Mr. Alien!

11:36.190 --> 11:37.260
W-What is it?

11:37.260 --> 11:38.530
I explained it, right?

11:38.530 --> 11:42.100
It's not that. You know,
when this is over...

11:42.100 --> 11:44.870
I want you to come over to my room!

11:44.870 --> 11:46.430
You had to say this now?

11:46.430 --> 11:48.800
I did! Promise me right now.

11:50.740 --> 11:52.710
Sure, if it's just that...

11:52.710 --> 11:53.740
You have to!

11:53.740 --> 11:54.730
I'll be waiting!

11:56.080 --> 11:57.040
Sheesh...

11:58.010 --> 11:59.410
All right!

11:59.410 --> 12:00.900
Let's take 'em on!

12:12.830 --> 12:14.860
Barnette, the rest is up to you.

12:14.860 --> 12:16.500
- Leave it to me!
- All right!

12:16.500 --> 12:17.570
I'll show them!

12:17.570 --> 12:19.330
Hey, don't go by yourself!

12:22.200 --> 12:23.600
Dita, Barnette...

12:23.600 --> 12:25.570
We'll head to the launch point.

12:25.570 --> 12:26.560
Roger!

12:29.410 --> 12:31.850
All units heading toward
the launch point!

12:31.850 --> 12:33.210
Please hurry...

12:33.210 --> 12:34.550
We don't have time.

12:41.520 --> 12:43.220
No!

12:43.220 --> 12:45.830
Vandread Jura has
reached the operation point!

12:45.830 --> 12:47.850
Dread units in position!

12:49.560 --> 12:50.830
Begin the operation!

12:59.710 --> 13:02.710
Don't miss. We have
to concentrate on one spot.

13:02.710 --> 13:06.040
What we need now is a match
at 100,000,000 degrees.

13:09.750 --> 13:12.820
The density of the
planet core is increasing.

13:12.820 --> 13:14.190
Thanks to the compression,

13:14.190 --> 13:16.790
the pressure inside the
gaseous planet is rising.

13:16.790 --> 13:18.160
Not yet?

13:18.160 --> 13:19.790
Don't take this so easy!

13:19.790 --> 13:22.230
The pressure's going up,
but if it doesn't ignite...

13:22.230 --> 13:24.530
everything goes to waste!

13:24.530 --> 13:25.520
Yeah, yeah...

13:26.570 --> 13:27.930
Hibiki, don't mess up.

13:33.310 --> 13:35.380
I hate doing the dirty work!

13:35.380 --> 13:38.010
Shut up and do your job!

13:38.010 --> 13:40.310
Dita! Your point is off!

13:41.680 --> 13:43.120
You're such a klutz.

13:43.120 --> 13:46.150
An attack from three sides
depends on our locations!

13:46.150 --> 13:47.590
Barnette.

13:47.590 --> 13:49.250
Smile. Smile.

13:52.560 --> 13:54.160
Dita, calm down.

13:54.160 --> 13:55.760
Correct up by 0.3 degrees!

13:55.760 --> 13:56.750
O-Okay!

13:57.930 --> 13:59.190
All right, she's back!

14:00.670 --> 14:02.570
Less than 3 minutes till critical!

14:02.570 --> 14:04.540
Please proceed with the sequence!

14:04.540 --> 14:06.410
Roger! Parfet, do it.

14:06.410 --> 14:07.640
All right!

14:07.640 --> 14:09.130
Everyone, we're going for it!

14:10.280 --> 14:11.250
Energy...

14:11.250 --> 14:12.370
...reverse!

14:16.480 --> 14:18.620
Do your best, Paksis!

14:18.620 --> 14:21.780
After the heat subsides,
all that's left is to breathe...

14:27.860 --> 14:30.700
The Paksis Pragma is
returning to normal values!

14:30.700 --> 14:32.700
We did it!

14:32.700 --> 14:36.400
The enemy ships are lining
up along a planetary orbit!

14:36.400 --> 14:38.740
Damage to Vandread Jura increasing!

14:51.690 --> 14:53.020
Not yet?

15:02.060 --> 15:03.030
They did it!

15:03.030 --> 15:05.030
Degeneration has started!

15:05.030 --> 15:06.270
We're leaving here!

15:06.270 --> 15:08.170
Bart, turn the ship around!

15:08.170 --> 15:09.160
Roger!

15:10.700 --> 15:13.170
Dita, from here on, speed is the key!

15:13.170 --> 15:15.040
- R-Roger!
- Dita!

15:15.040 --> 15:16.030
Y-Yes?

15:17.110 --> 15:18.640
Do your job.

15:19.710 --> 15:20.700
Yeah.

15:22.580 --> 15:23.580
All right!

15:23.580 --> 15:24.640
- Time to split!
- Yeah!

15:28.760 --> 15:30.160
The point is off!

15:30.160 --> 15:31.890
It's because you made me wait!

15:38.930 --> 15:40.070
All right!

15:40.070 --> 15:42.300
Catch me, Mr. Alien!

15:47.610 --> 15:49.140
Good distance!

15:49.140 --> 15:52.350
If I missed, I'd never
hear your wisecracks again.

15:52.350 --> 15:54.180
Heh, same goes for me.

15:55.250 --> 15:56.240
Let's go!

16:03.260 --> 16:04.850
Asteroids up ahead!

16:08.430 --> 16:11.270
The shield is weakening!
It's dangerous to enter!

16:11.270 --> 16:12.900
Where are you planning to go?

16:12.900 --> 16:14.270
You say that, but...

16:14.270 --> 16:15.570
Hot! Hot!

16:19.010 --> 16:20.640
Shift thrusters to manual!

16:20.640 --> 16:22.510
Fire them matching Bart's movements!

16:22.510 --> 16:23.500
Roger!

16:29.150 --> 16:30.620
- Bart!
- Impossible!

16:32.350 --> 16:33.290
No!

16:47.970 --> 16:49.670
All right!

16:49.670 --> 16:50.660
I got it.

16:52.210 --> 16:53.740
I'll leave the rest to you.

16:53.740 --> 16:55.440
Be sure to come back.

16:55.440 --> 16:56.430
Yeah!

16:57.410 --> 16:59.850
Dita, Sequence Four!

16:59.850 --> 17:00.840
Roger!

17:07.920 --> 17:09.220
Let's go!

17:09.220 --> 17:10.210
Yeah!

17:21.540 --> 17:23.330
Go!

17:55.440 --> 17:56.940
We did it...

17:56.940 --> 17:59.430
We actually won.

18:05.410 --> 18:07.480
I-Impossible...

18:07.480 --> 18:09.510
They're so persistent...

18:12.990 --> 18:16.420
A flare from the star is
coming behind Vandread Dita!

18:16.860 --> 18:18.960
What are you two doing?

18:18.960 --> 18:21.300
- Not yet!
- Yeah, not yet!

18:21.300 --> 18:22.280
What?

18:25.500 --> 18:26.490
Dita!

18:28.540 --> 18:30.700
Vandread Dita's signature is lost.

18:33.440 --> 18:35.010
You idiot!

18:35.010 --> 18:37.640
Dying doesn't mean anything!

18:37.640 --> 18:39.270
Don't go off and kill me!

18:42.580 --> 18:45.890
A high-pressure energy form
is emerging from the flare!

18:45.890 --> 18:46.850
What?

18:47.820 --> 18:50.290
I swear. What a man...

18:55.160 --> 18:57.530
Go!

18:58.870 --> 19:00.570
I'll never give up!

19:00.570 --> 19:01.500
I promised!

19:10.680 --> 19:13.350
It was worth living a long life...

19:13.350 --> 19:18.220
I never thought I would see
the exact moment a star was born.

19:26.060 --> 19:27.230
No good...

19:27.230 --> 19:29.300
I can't move...

19:29.300 --> 19:31.900
I can't move no matter what happens...

19:31.900 --> 19:34.370
We did it! We did it! We did it!

19:34.370 --> 19:36.300
Ow! Stop that!

19:44.310 --> 19:45.910
- Welcome back!
- Welcome back!

19:45.910 --> 19:47.780
Welcome back!

19:50.420 --> 19:51.750
You're amazing!

19:53.750 --> 19:56.160
I see you in a different light.

19:56.160 --> 19:57.760
No!

19:57.760 --> 19:59.260
You can't!

19:59.260 --> 20:00.590
What?

20:00.590 --> 20:03.730
That was just for saving all of us!

20:03.730 --> 20:05.170
I said you can't!

20:05.170 --> 20:07.670
Mr. Alien has a promise with me!

20:07.670 --> 20:08.970
Right?

20:08.970 --> 20:10.940
What? A promise?

20:10.940 --> 20:12.770
A promise is a promise!

20:12.770 --> 20:14.510
I mean what promise?

20:14.510 --> 20:15.680
I won't tell you!

20:15.680 --> 20:16.910
What?

20:16.910 --> 20:19.310
W-W-We have a problem!

20:19.310 --> 20:21.080
What? Don't get in my way!

20:21.080 --> 20:23.080
This is no time for that!

20:23.080 --> 20:24.110
Look at this!

20:25.090 --> 20:29.160
Earth found out that the Nirvana
destroyed one of their flagships!

20:29.160 --> 20:32.530
Hearing the news, other fleets
that were in other solar systems

20:32.530 --> 20:35.020
all changed their
targets to Mejale and Tarak!

20:36.830 --> 20:38.670
T-There's five...

20:38.670 --> 20:42.260
We barely managed to
get rid of one just now...

20:46.240 --> 20:47.770
What's with you guys?

20:47.770 --> 20:49.840
Backing down just like that.

20:49.840 --> 20:51.750
We know what to do.

20:51.750 --> 20:53.510
No matter how high the wall...

20:53.510 --> 20:57.120
...we have to climb over it
to show proof we existed.

20:57.120 --> 20:59.150
And to do that...

20:59.150 --> 21:01.360
We have to take the path we've got!

21:01.360 --> 21:02.340
Right?

21:04.320 --> 21:05.630
Yeah!

21:05.630 --> 21:08.560
We have to take the path we have, huh?

21:09.960 --> 21:13.130
That boy is getting
clever with his words lately.

21:13.130 --> 21:15.700
Yes, I'm looking forward to his future.

21:15.700 --> 21:16.690
Yes.

21:18.470 --> 21:23.470
As long as there is life,
there is no end to the journey of life.

21:32.150 --> 21:37.760
Hey, you realized what the words,

21:37.760 --> 21:43.260
I really wanted to hear are, right?

21:43.260 --> 21:49.500
I was looking at your profile as
you talked about the distant future.

21:49.500 --> 21:59.810
Take me with you to the depths of dreams.

21:59.810 --> 22:02.350
Hey, with all of my body.

22:02.350 --> 22:14.130
A pistol named love shoots
through the center of my chest.

22:14.130 --> 22:25.740
Negotiations and common
sense hold no meaning at all.

22:25.740 --> 22:37.550
Pull the trigger named love and
shoot through my frozen heart.

22:37.550 --> 22:51.420
Pour in your love
to the tips of my fingers.
